---
layout: null
# Rendered from _data/linux_release.json (the .deb's data file), which the
# release flow (taigikeyboard's scripts/announce-release.sh) is the only
# writer of — same shape as appcast/macos.json, for the reason recorded there.
#
# Contract for these fields lives in taigikeyboard's windows/updates/README.md
# § Wire format; the reader is taigi-desktop-update::manifest in the Linux
# settings window. Linux has no in-app install (a .deb / .rpm / Arch package
# needs root, and three formats share one release), so the manifest names
# only the version and the release page that lists all three packages: no
# packageURL, and the reader offers the download page.
---
{
  "version": {{ site.data.linux_release.version | jsonify }},
  "downloadPageURL": {{ site.data.linux_release.releasePageURL | jsonify }}
}
